#: ../../../pro/reports/components_filters.md:480
msgid "See also: `left`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../pro/reports/components_filters.md:488
msgid ""
"**left**: Left margin. Has the effect of moving the image right (positive "
"pixel number) or left (negative pixel number), relative to the left border "
"of the cell. This is very handy to fine-tune the position of graphics object."
msgstr ""

